  "title": "Lemon Cloud Pie I",
  "description": "First you make a simple lemon custard, then you stir in cream cheese, and then comes the sweetened whipped egg whites. That &#39;s the cloud-like part. This lovely pale yellow filling is then spooned into a baked crust and chilled. Serve with fresh, sliced strawberries or blueberries.",
